# Files excluded from Prettier formatting.
#
# Prettier 3 also honours .gitignore by default, so build output and Nx caches
# are already excluded by it. The entries below keep this file self-sufficient
# if Prettier is ever run with an explicit --ignore-path.

# Build output
dist
out-tsc
coverage

# Nx local caches and generated workspace state
.nx/

# Generated by the package manager. Formatting it would be undone by the next
# `pnpm install` and churn the diff for nothing.
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Quoted verbatim from someone else - reflowing it would edit their words.
requirements.md
